  "analysis": "I now have a complete understanding of the anti-regression rules from SKILL.md. The key rules are: 1) Use browser/tools with credentials, 2) Start highest priority task, 3) Keep responses brief (under 5 lines), 4) Do instead of explaining, 5) Search first when needing info, 6) Fix broken things yourself, 7) Research immediately, 8) Do useful work when idle. I can now create the required output files.",
